WEBVTT

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.351
if there isn't a way to guide us through.

00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:07.226
Now I'm not suggesting
that data is bad and story is good.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:09.518
They both play a key role.

00:07:09.542 --> 00:07:10.809
And to understand how,

00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:13.518
you have to see what makes a great story.

00:07:13.542 --> 00:07:16.143
It's going to answer three questions.

00:07:16.167 --> 00:07:17.851
The first is:

00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:19.809
What is the context?

00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:22.434
Meaning, what's the setting,
who is involved,

00:07:22.458 --> 00:07:24.934
why should I even care?

00:07:24.958 --> 00:07:26.934
What is the conflict,

00:07:26.958 --> 00:07:30.018
where is that moment
where everything changes?